Using the standard normal distribution, we have $P(-1 \leq Z \leq 2) = P(Z \leq 2) - P(Z \leq -1) = P(Z \leq 2) - (1 - P(Z \leq 1)) = P(Z \leq 2) + P(Z \leq 1) - 1$.
